<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper B · Learner paper</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-1/b/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 1 Course Review · Original Paper B</p><h1>Paper B · Learner paper</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace to practise with section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need manual review.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper B</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 15 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. How many people are in the speaker’s family?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三个人</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四个人</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五个人</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. Who stays home and cooks on Saturday?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 妈妈</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 哥哥</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. Who is on Grandfather’s left?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 妈妈</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 姐姐</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. What is the new student’s family name?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 林</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 王</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 马</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Where do the students eat lunch?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 教室</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 食堂</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 操场</div></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. Where should students put their bags?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 椅子上</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 桌子上</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 地上</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. How many books may the student borrow at one time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一本</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两本</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三本</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. Where will today’s PE lesson take place?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 教室</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 图书馆</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 操场</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. What should students do first?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 写名字</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 打开书</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 看答案</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. When should the student meet the teacher?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午两点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午一点四十五</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午两点十五</div></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. What food does the customer finally order?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 面包</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 面条</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 包子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. How many cups of HOT TEA are requested?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三杯</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两杯</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五杯</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. Which fruit does the customer choose?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 苹果</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 香蕉</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 橙子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. How much change does the customer receive?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九块</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十块</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一块</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. Which item belongs to the older sister?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 围巾</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 帽子</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 外套</div></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. When do they agree to meet?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上午八点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 上午十点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 中午十二点</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. When should the girl call?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午四点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午三点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午五点</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. What color are the boy’s sports shoes?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 黑色</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 红色</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白色</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What will the boy do on Wednesday afternoon?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 去公园</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 游泳</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 看电影</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What will the girl do BEFORE playing ball?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 画画</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 唱歌</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 游泳</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 20 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. In which month is Tian Le’s birthday?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">姓名：田乐<br>学校：青禾学校<br>生日：六月十日<br>哥哥生日：十月五日<br>喜欢：看书、打篮球<br>想认识喜欢运动的朋友。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十月</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六月</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十二月</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. How many people are in Xiaoxia’s family?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我叫小夏。我家有六个人：爷爷、奶奶、爸爸、妈妈、弟弟和我。我们住在学校旁边。弟弟明年也要上学。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 四个人</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 五个人</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 六个人</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. Where does the mother work?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我们家的工作地点<br>爸爸：饭店，做饭。<br>妈妈：学校，教英语。<br>姐姐：商店，卖衣服。<br>星期日晚上，我们常在家一起吃饭。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 学校</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 饭店</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 商店</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Who will Xiaowu take a walk with after dinner?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">阿东：<br>我今天晚上不去你家了。哥哥要工作，爸爸妈妈要去买东西。我在家和妹妹吃饭，饭后和妹妹一起散步。<br>小武</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 爸爸妈妈</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 妹妹</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Where should Ma Li sit?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">新座位<br>小青：门旁边。<br>马力：窗户旁边。<br>田乐：老师前面的第一排。<br>下周一请大家按这个安排坐，不要拿错别人的书。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 窗户旁边</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 门旁边</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 第一排</div></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. When can students borrow books on Thursday?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">学校图书馆通知<br>星期四上午不开门，下午两点到五点可以借书。还书也请在这个时间来。星期五上午九点正常开门。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上午九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午三点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 晚上七点</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. Where is the English book?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">同桌：<br>你的英语书在后面的书架上，中文书在桌子上，练习本在椅子上。我先去吃饭，你拿到书以后来找我。<br>小苏</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 桌子上</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 椅子上</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 书架上</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. What should Tian Ming do?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">放学前的工作<br>赵平：擦黑板。<br>田明：关窗户。<br>小苏：把书放到书架上。<br>请做完以后再回家。今天老师在办公室。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 关窗户</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 擦黑板</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把书放好</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Where should students go if it rains?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">二班通知<br>明天体育课，请大家下午两点到操场，不要在教室等。带水，穿运动鞋。下雨就改在体育馆，时间不变。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 教室</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 体育馆</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 操场</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. When does the break start?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">周五上午<br>8:00—9:00 中文课<br>9:00—10:00 英语课<br>10:00—10:30 休息<br>10:30—11:30 数学课<br>十一点半以后吃午饭。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十点</div></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. Which drink is NOT sold today?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">青禾食堂早餐<br>面包：三元一个<br>包子：两元一个<br>热茶：两元一杯<br>牛奶：四元一杯<br>早上七点开始卖。今天不卖咖啡。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 咖啡</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 热茶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 牛奶</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which item has TWO portions on the receipt?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">午饭小票<br>米饭：两份<br>面条：一份<br>水：一瓶<br>两份米饭放在一起，面条另外装。请拿好小票，到窗口取餐。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 面条</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 米饭</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 水</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. What does Xiaohe ask Dad NOT to add?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">爸爸：<br>今天我想吃面条，不想吃鸡蛋。请给我加一些青菜，不要加鸡蛋。弟弟想吃米饭。我们十二点到家。<br>小禾</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 青菜</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 米饭</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 鸡蛋</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. Who wants tea without sugar?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">请按这个单子买饮料：<br>爸爸：不加糖的茶。<br>妈妈：热咖啡。<br>弟弟：苹果汁。<br>买好后放在桌上，别拿错了。谢谢！</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 妈妈</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 弟弟</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. Which T-shirt should Xiaofang collect for Aping?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小方：<br>我在商店买了一件大号黄色T恤，请你帮我拿回来。中号绿色那件是小田的，不要拿错。我的名字在袋子上。<br>阿平</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 中号绿色</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 大号黄色</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小号黄色</div></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. When does Xiaoyu need to go home?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小田：<br>周日我下午四点去你家看书。五点半我要回家吃饭，不能留到六点。你觉得四点去可以吗？<br>小余</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午四点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午六点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午五点半</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. On which evening is the writer explicitly free to meet friends?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我的晚上安排<br>周一：上画画课。<br>周二：去游泳。<br>周三：在家，有空，可以和朋友见面。<br>周四：和家人一起吃饭。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 周三</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 周一</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 周二</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which item is Xiaotian looking for?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">找衣服<br>我把一件绿色毛衣忘在公园了，上面写着“小田”。门口的白外套是小方的，不是我的。看到绿毛衣请告诉我。<br>小田</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 白外套</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 绿色毛衣</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 蓝帽子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. Where does the singing group meet?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">唱歌小组<br>喜欢唱歌的同学，周四下午四点到二楼教室。王老师教大家唱新歌。画画小组在一楼，不要走错地方。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一楼</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三楼</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 二楼</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. Which activity do BOTH friends like?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">李平：我喜欢跳舞，不喜欢画画。<br>周月：我喜欢画画，也喜欢跳舞。<br>两人想找一个都喜欢的活动，星期天下午一起去。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 跳舞</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 画画</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 游泳</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 15 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 15 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Arrange a reading visit</h2><p>Reply in Chinese to your classmate. Say whether you can join the Wednesday reading visit, give a time or propose another day, and ask one question about the visit. About 20-40 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. You may invent personal details.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小方：你好！星期三放学后一起去图书馆看书，好吗？你三点还是四点有空？<br>小叶</p></div><ul><li>Respond to the Wednesday invitation.</li><li>Give a workable time or an alternative day.</li><li>Ask one relevant question about the visit.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Introduce a pen friend</h2><p>Read Heyue’s fictional message. Introduce Heyue in Chinese to another classmate, using third-person wording or the name. Include name and age, school and class starting time, and at least one preference. About 40-70 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">你好！我叫何月，今年十四岁，在青禾学校二班上学。我们上午八点半上课。我喜欢看书，也喜欢游泳，不喜欢唱歌。希望认识新朋友！</p></div><ul><li>Identify Heyue by name and age.</li><li>Give the school and class starting time.</li><li>Give at least one preference consistent with the message.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Plan an activity with a new friend</h2><p>Answer four recorded prompts in Chinese. Each plays twice, then allows 10 seconds to prepare and up to 20 seconds to record. Use real or invented information. The four responses form ONE task out of eight. This is fixed-prompt practice, not an adaptive conversation.</p><p>A new friend asks about your family, interests and school day, then suggests a weekend outing.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Describe a Thursday at school</h2><p>Introduce the fictional student’s Thursday in Chinese from the card. Include the student’s name, school and at least one class time, and an after-school activity. You have 60 seconds to prepare and up to 60 seconds to speak. Simple sentences are sufficient; no minimum recording length applies.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">许乐的星期四<br>学校：青禾学校<br>上午八点半：开始上课<br>中午十二点：和同学在食堂吃饭<br>下午四点：下课<br>下课后：和朋友在操场打篮球</p></div><ul><li>Identify Xu Le.</li><li>Give the school and at least one class time.</li><li>Describe the after-school activity on the card.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section></main></body></html>